  "description": "This seamless pattern is designed to add a stylish and unique touch to your creative projects. Featuring a beautiful blend of colors and artistic elements, it creates a visually appealing and versatile design.\nPerfect for fabric, digital papers, scrapbooking, packaging, and more. The seamless repeat ensures a smooth and continuous flow, making it ideal for any project size. High-quality and suitable for both personal and commercial use.\n– You will receive\n– 40 individual JPG files:\n✨ Features:\n👉 High-resolution design\n👉 (12×12) Inches, 300 DPI\n👉 Seamless repeating pattern\n👉 Perfect for print and digital use\n👉 Suitable for various creative projects\n👉 High Resolution\n👉 Each element is provided in JPG format, ensuring compatibility with various digital or print projects.\n👉 Follow to discover more awesome artwork.",
